<br>ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  sidebarLayout</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    sidebarPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      uiOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;language&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    mainPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      textOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;someText&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>shinyApp </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><br>If something does not work for you then you should give some details what exactly did not work. Otherwise we can not help you.<br></div>"
