     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I think you should just make the 20 variables. But you don&#39;t need to make them by hand:</div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br><div>translation_df &lt;- data.frame(English = c(&quot;Hello&quot;, &quot;Goodbye&quot;),</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>  Spanish = c(&quot;Hola&quot;, &quot;Adios&quot;))</div><div><br></div><div>ui &lt;- fluidPage(</div><div>  ...</div><div>  helpText(textOutput(&quot;txt1&quot;))</div><div>)</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div>server &lt;- function(input, output, session) {</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>  # Make all the rows into variables</div><div>  for (rowname in rownames(translation_df) {</div><div>    local({</div><div>      row &lt;- rowname  # need our own copy of rowname inside of local scope</div><div>      output[[paste0(&quot;txt&quot;, row)]] &lt;- renderText(translation_df[row,input$language])</div><div>    })</div><div>  }</div><div>}</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
